{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROMISE PAYMENT ICONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Renders payment badges in an explicit order, rather than the order Shopify happens to return from
`shop.enabled_payment_types`. Icons themselves still come from Shopify via `payment_type_svg_tag`,
so they stay current and correctly licenced.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* types: comma-separated list of payment type handles, in the order they should appear (required)
* amex_icon: optional image that replaces the American Express badge, for when the stock one is disliked
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign payment_types = types | remove: ' ' | split: ',' -%}

{%- if payment_types.size > 0 -%}
  <div class="promise-payment-icons">
    {%- for type in payment_types -%}
      {%- if type == 'american_express' and amex_icon != blank -%}
        {{-
          amex_icon
          | image_url: width: 160
          | image_tag:
            widths: '40,60,80,120,160',
            sizes: '38px',
            loading: 'lazy',
            alt: 'American Express',
            class: 'promise-payment-icons__custom'
        -}}
      {%- else -%}
        {{- type | payment_type_svg_tag -}}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
